WEBVTT

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:14.350
<i>Demonbane...</i>

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:19.720
We've swapped out 70% of
the damaged parts and armor.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:24.160
We estimate it will take
thirty-two hours to finish the job!

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:27.960
Magical circuitry is 57% back on-line.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:31.900
It will take some time to recover lost data.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:36.730
And once that's done, we need to
tune and synchronize it, as well.

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.080
This is going to take forever!

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:40.790
Stop just standing there, and fix it.

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:43.580
If the enemy attacks, we can't fight back.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:48.710
Whose fault do you think Demonbane's
condition is?!

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:52.700
Any fight, against anyone, 
will result in some damage.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.330
That's what combat is.

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:56.270
Selfish little...

00:01:56.270 --> 00:02:01.400
I still haven't accepted you as
Demonbane's official pilots!

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:04.670
You can't even move it on your own.

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:08.580
Hey, stop it, Al.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:14.150
Listen! The ones who are actually in Demonbane,
fighting the Black Lodge, are—

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:19.150
What are you doing?! How rude!

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:21.750
You...

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:27.390
You couldn't understand how I feel!

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.940
I'm terribly sorry.

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:46.650
But Demonbane holds special
meaning for Miss Ruri.

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:48.150
Special meaning?

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:49.610
Yes.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:56.690
To her, Demonbane symbolizes
both her feelings and resolve.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:04.030
Do you know why, at her age, Miss Ruri
is the Hado Foundation's head?

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:04.960
No...

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:13.040
When she was very young,
her parents were killed,

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:18.400
in retaliation for fighting
against the Black Lodge.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:23.140
Ever since then, her only relative
was her grandfather,

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:27.400
Kozo Hado, head of the Hado Foundation.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:34.070
Her grandfather spent his entire
life building Demonbane,

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:37.200
for use in resistance against the Black Lodge.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:43.900
Yes. To her, Demonbane is a
memento of her late grandfather,

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:49.600
a sword to fight the Black Lodge,
and a symbol that protects the city.

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:54.880
That's what Demonbane means to her.

00:03:57.890 --> 00:04:00.690
<i>Grandfather... Why?</i>

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:05.700
<i>Why are all these terrible
things allowed to happen?</i>

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:08.490
<i>Is there no God?</i>

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.960
<i>Ruri,</i>

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:15.340
<i>it may be true that the
world is filled with evil.</i>

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:16.330
<i>But...</i>

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.550
Justice...

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.090
What's going on?

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:40.520
What's this?

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:41.990
An enemy attack?

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:43.790
Hello? Hello?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.030
Is no one there?

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:46.760
Hello?

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:49.770
Hello? Hello?

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:51.710
It's no use.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:53.440
I can't reach the surface.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:56.000
Kuro, can you sense it?

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.950
This thick stench of evil...

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:02.410
Yeah. This awful feeling, sticking to my skin...

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.810
There's no doubt.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.790
Black Lodge!

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:21.700
We're going on ahead, butler!

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:22.790
I'm counting on you.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.520
Pathetic.

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.970
My, this is our first chance
for some fun, in ages!

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:38.350
Gotta have more fun.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.530
I'm not interested in your hobbies.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:45.320
Then let's split up.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.220
It isn't connecting to anything.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:49.880
What's happening here?

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:51.890
It can't be!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.910
We're almost there, Kuro!

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:01.740
Okay, let's go!

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:08.870
Winfield, where are you?

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:10.820
Isn't anyone there?

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.560
Give me a detailed—

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.800
Found you!

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.500
This is awful...

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.290
What are they up to?

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:36.820
That voice!

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:37.580
The princess!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:41.180
Don't be so scared.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:43.650
Have some fun with me.

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.480
N-No!

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.500
<i>If I can get downstairs, to the base...</i>

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.990
That's not nice.

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:08.210
I said I wanted to play...

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.640
The sense of darkness is getting stronger!

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:12.980
Keep up your guard!

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:15.080
Understood!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.720
What?

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.120
This sensation...

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:25.490
The <i>Necronomicon</i>?

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:29.730
I see. So you're Kuro Daijuji?

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:30.960
You're...

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:33.230
Titus,

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:36.930
lowest-ranking Anticross member.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:38.440
Anticross?

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:43.330
Even within the Black Lodge,
they are powerful mages,

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:47.410
serving Master Therion himself!

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:51.420
Al, we don't have time for this clown.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:52.550
Let's find the princess.

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:53.850
It's too late.

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:57.020
My companion will have found her by now.

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:57.790
What?!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.490
So nothing left to worry about?

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:02.240
Then fight me,

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:03.330
Kuro Daijuji—

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.220
No, I'm afraid that won't be happening.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:05.660
What?

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:06.330
Butler!

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:09.730
Mr. Daijuji, there's no time.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:13.670
Leave this to me, and hurry to Miss Ruri.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.110
Wh-What?

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:18.950
Her room is at the end of this hall.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:21.080
Don't worry about me.

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.950
Okay, right.

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:24.720
Don't die, butler!

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.450
Wait—

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:29.150
I'll be happy to satisfy your needs.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:31.300
Are you sane, human?

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.360
Yes, of course.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:57.980
Oh, my...

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:01.520
If you don't hurry and run
away, I'll catch you...

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:07.290
See?

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.910
Yes, that scream...

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:14.320
Miss Ruri?

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.180
I love it!

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.670
No... S-Someone!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:21.360
Young ones are so nice.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.440
Their skin is so fresh.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:25.010
I'm jealous!

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:28.610
Now, what do you want me to do with you?

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:31.450
S-Save me, Winfield...

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:34.540
I don't want you breaking that easily!

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:45.360
You...

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.060
D-Damn you!

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:52.490
Kuro Daijuji!

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.880
Pervert!

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:00.660
No one's into tentacles anymore!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.380
You're also part of Anticross, right?

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:03.890
That's right.

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:06.050
My name is Tiberius.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:07.350
Nice to meet you.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:09.820
But that wasn't very nice, Kuro.

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:14.850
Miss Ruri and I were just
about to have some fun.

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:17.570
And you just came in and ruined it.

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:21.130
I think that's wrong...

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.870
I really do!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.340
This national game called "boxing"?

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.790
Fool.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:31.040
You think you can challenge me,
even without a weapon?

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.620
That's correct.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:34.700
I am completely unarmed.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:36.110
But can you tell

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:40.550
how dangerous I am with the gloves off?

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:42.290
Then...

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:53.920
You dodged that?

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.300
Commendable.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.230
A shock wave from his fist?

00:10:57.230 --> 00:11:01.740
Honed over many years,
boxing is the highest art

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:03.380
humanity has produced.

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:05.150
If you insist on mocking it as a game,

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:08.950
I'll be happy to demonstrate what it can do.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:11.020
Mr. Bushido.

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:23.930
How was that?

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.660
Don't get cocky!

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:27.930
Watch out!

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:30.890
Damn you...

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:34.440
This is it!

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:45.440
I see.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:47.020
Impressive.

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:49.520
There isn't a single opening in your stance.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:55.560
But there's no sense in simply standing here.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.530
I'll make the first move.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:01.530
<i>Secret Technique: Toccata!</i>

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.770
Here I go.

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:08.710
He's fast.

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:09.630
But...

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:22.080
That Anticross guy wasn't so impressive.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.690
Sorry I was late, princess.

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:28.660
Hey, princess...

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:32.680
Um, well... It's all right.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:33.630
You can relax.

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:39.240
You... You don't need to tell me that!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.600
Don't look at me.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:42.860
I have no idea!

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:45.520
Jeez, what a mess...

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:55.190
I-Is something wrong?

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:57.530
No... Nothing...

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:03.460
It's still dangerous. We should
head for the base, downstairs...

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:11.920
Um, well... Sorry...

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.370
Stop staring!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:15.560
I'm not staring!

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:20.040
Anyway, we need to hurry—

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:22.810
Mr. Daijuji!

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:24.070
Kuro!

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:33.090
I retract my earlier words and apologize.

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:35.460
I underestimated you.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:39.730
I didn't anticipate I'd be able to
fight such a fierce opponent.

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.070
I thank you, warrior.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:45.100
There's no need to thank me.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:48.210
I simply carry out my task.

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:52.180
My fists are in Miss Ruri's service!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:56.250
Can you withstand the strike
from these two blades,

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.150
wounded as you are?

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:01.650
Speed isn't the only card I hold in my hand.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.830
Mr. Daijuji! Mr. Daijuji!

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:08.820
Kuro! Wake up!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.070
Kuro!

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:12.800
You let down your guard, Kuro.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:15.190
I see, you...

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:17.000
You finally get it?

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:22.670
You were dead from the start!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:26.270
Yes. I have attained immortality,

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:29.310
through the power of <i>De
Vermis Mysteriis</i>.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:35.290
Now that the interruption
is gone, let's continue our fun.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.130
You're really aggravating!

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:48.360
Enough out of you, you rotting corpse!

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:49.850
Mr. Daijuji!

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:51.580
I'm sorry, princess...

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.840
I let something awful happen to you again.

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:55.680
I can understand why you'd think

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:58.450
I'm unworthy to pilot Demonbane
the way I am.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.040
Kuro, you...

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.040
But I'll pay them back.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.680
I'll kill this guy!

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:11.420
No! You're bleeding so badly...

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:19.530
<i>Ruri, it may be true that the
world is filled with evil.</i>

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:27.100
<i>But a justice also exists,
which despises that evil.</i>

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:29.170
Daijuji...

00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:34.750
You're talking pretty tough for
someone who's half dead!

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:40.980
No one likes overly persistent guys!

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:43.710
Kuro!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:44.690
Mr. Daijuji!

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.640
Wh-Why don't you just die, already?

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:08.510
I-Impossible...

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:21.390
I'll chop you up so bad,
you won't be able to regenerate!

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:22.990
Take this!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:42.010
Don't screw with me!

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:43.980
That's...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.720
Tiberius... The fool.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:04.660
My Deus Machina, Belzebuth...

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.190
Devour my foes!

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:14.750
A Deus...

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:16.150
Machina...

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:19.320
Wh-What is that?

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:22.750
I've detected irregularities in phase space.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.440
A massive magical energy.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.290
No, I can't trace it.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:28.360
That's impossible...

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.060
A Deus Machina?

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:35.070
A mechanical god, birthed by magic!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:39.380
Mistress?

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:42.540
What are you doing, looking away
in the midst of combat?

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:49.530
That hurt... That hurt, Kuro Daijuji.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:52.640
I guess you need punishment.

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:02.430
You can't lose any more blood!

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:04.930
Al, Demonbane...

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.130
Don't be stupid!

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:07.320
With those wounds...

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:08.560
Just do it...

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.170
Mr. Daijuji!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.600
Sorry, princess...

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:15.300
I'm borrowing Demonbane again.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:17.410
You mustn't, Mr. Daijuji!

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.360
Yeah!

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:22.440
If you fight while this badly injured,
you won't stand a chance!

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:25.150
Even so, I'm going to fight!

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:26.780
Mr. Daijuji...

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:32.860
If we just let that guy go,
he'll take everything from us.

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:36.480
So I need it!

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.800
Mr. Daijuji, you...

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:41.980
Demonbane...

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:42.800
K-Kuro!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.980
Vanish, Kuro Daijuji.

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:48.200
It won't make it here in time!

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:50.350
No!

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:51.210
You...

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:54.110
This man, Mr. Daijuji...

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:57.550
Die!

00:18:57.550 --> 00:18:58.710
That's enough.

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:00.220
This voice...

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:01.790
Grand Master!

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:03.510
Enough.

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:04.420
Return.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.270
Don't be stupid!

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:10.490
After all that's been done to
us, Anticross can't just—

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:12.350
Your task is finished.

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:13.840
I'll say it once more.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.410
Tiberius, return.

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:20.960
If we don't kill an enemy right before us,
then what is the Black Lodge?

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:23.050
I'm going to murder this kid...

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:31.740
Return.

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.080
Yes, sir!

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:36.220
Please forgive me!

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:44.030
Just you wait, Kuro Daijuji!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:47.950
Next time we meet, I'll make you suffer!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:53.470
I've been ordered to return.

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:57.440
I haven't heard your name.

00:19:57.440 --> 00:20:01.410
I am Winfield, butler to the Hado family.

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:07.380
Then, warrior Winfield,
I look forward to meeting you again.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:17.130
Looks like he saved us...

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:19.470
Master Therion!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.960
Body slam!

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:31.850
Don't body slam the wounded...

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:35.580
Good! It looks like you're recovering well.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.830
Kuro, this apple is good...

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.750
And don't eat my apple!

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:43.890
Well, his toughness is the one
thing he's got going for him.

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:44.870
And you!

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:49.370
Is that something you say to a man
with a hole in his stomach?

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:51.850
Um... Mr. Kuro?

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:53.900
If you move around too much,
you'll open your wounds...

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:58.270
Blood! What is this?

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:04.660
<i>The one who believes in a justice,
which is small but definitely there,</i>

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:06.980
<i>wielding the demon-slaying sword...</i>

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:12.060
<i>That may have been the kind of
person my grandfather sought.</i>

00:22:55.050 --> 00:22:57.100
A bright blue sky above us.

00:22:57.100 --> 00:22:59.770
And an endless blue sea below.

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:03.350
This is Innsmouth, the last paradise on Earth.

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:06.150
Next time: The Shadow Over Innsmouth.

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:07.900
Trouble in the sea and hot springs.

00:23:07.900 --> 00:23:10.000
And watch out for giant monsters!
